abstract: >-
  A multi-agent LLM equity-research pipeline with cost-governed model routing,
  deterministic signal code, a calibrated ML gate that can abstain, and an
  evaluation with a pre-registered control experiment. A research demonstration,
  not investment advice.
keywords:
  - multi-agent systems
  - large language models
  - model routing
  - machine learning
  - evaluation
  - calibration
  - pre-registration
  - time series
